---
<figure class="blueprint">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 460" role="img" aria-label="Blueprint sketch: the existing transfer pool, with no new outlay, feeds a formula in which a state's grant is a base floor plus population times one plus beta times the Social Deprivation Index, all multiplied by a performance multiplier alpha bounded between 0.85 and 1.15. Better outcomes raise alpha. A three-year rollout pilots the index in year one, switches on the multiplier in year two, and moves to a fiscal gap model in year three." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <pattern id="bp-grid" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M20 0H0V20" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-opacity="0.07" stroke-width="1" /></pattern>
      <pattern id="bp-hatch" width="7" height="7" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(45)"><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="7" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-opacity="0.7" /></pattern>
      <filter id="bp-wob" x="-4%" y="-4%" width="108%" height="108%"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.035" numOctaves="2" seed="7" result="n" /><feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="n" scale="3" /></filter>
      <filter id="bp-wob-t" x="-4%" y="-4%" width="108%" height="108%"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.05" numOctaves="1" seed="3" result="n" /><feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="n" scale="1.3" /></filter>
      <marker id="bp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" refX="10" refY="6" markerWidth="15" markerHeight="15" markerUnits="userSpaceOnUse" orient="auto"><path d="M2 2 L10 6 L2 10" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <rect width="760" height="460" fill="#003366" />
    <rect width="760" height="460" fill="url(#bp-grid)" />
    <g filter="url(#bp-wob)" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <rect x="24" y="70" width="150" height="70" rx="6" />
      <rect x="232" y="58" width="300" height="94" rx="6" />
      <rect x="590" y="70" width="146" height="70" rx="6" />
      <rect x="190" y="210" width="190" height="84" rx="6" />
      <rect x="410" y="210" width="190" height="84" rx="6" />
      <rect x="450" y="350" width="150" height="60" rx="6" />
      <rect x="24" y="350" width="124" height="76" rx="6" />
      <rect x="168" y="350" width="124" height="76" rx="6" />
      <rect x="312" y="350" width="124" height="76" rx="6" />
      <path d="M176 105 L228 105" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M534 105 L586 105" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M285 208 L300 156" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M505 208 L470 156" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M525 348 L525 298" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M663 142 C 706 250, 696 376, 604 384" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M150 388 L166 388" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" stroke-width="2" />
      <path d="M294 388 L310 388" marker-end="url(#bp-arrow)" stroke-width="2" />
    </g>
    <g filter="url(#bp-wob-t)" class="bp-text">
      <text x="24" y="38" class="l">Fig. 1  How the grant is worked out</text>
      <text x="99" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="m">existing pool,</text>
      <text x="99" y="123" text-anchor="middle" class="s">no new outlay</text>
      <text x="382" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="l">Grant = base floor</text>
      <text x="382" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="l">+ pop × (1 + β·SDI) × α</text>
      <text x="663" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="l">State</text>
      <text x="285" y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="m b">SDI: deprivation</text>
      <text x="285" y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="s">education 0.4, health 0.4,</text>
      <text x="285" y="282" text-anchor="middle" class="s">living standards 0.2</text>
      <text x="505" y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="m b">α: performance</text>
      <text x="505" y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="s">multiplier, bounded</text>
      <text x="505" y="282" text-anchor="middle" class="s">0.85 to 1.15</text>
      <text x="536" y="328" class="s">rewards</text>
      <text x="525" y="386" text-anchor="middle" class="m">outcomes improve</text>
      <text x="680" y="262" text-anchor="end" class="s">delivers</text>
      <text x="24" y="338" class="s">3-year rollout, budget neutral</text>
      <text x="86" y="374" text-anchor="middle" class="s b">Year 1</text>
      <text x="86" y="394" text-anchor="middle" class="s">pilot SDI in</text>
      <text x="86" y="412" text-anchor="middle" class="s">10–15% of grants</text>
      <text x="230" y="374" text-anchor="middle" class="s b">Year 2</text>
      <text x="230" y="394" text-anchor="middle" class="s">multiplier live</text>
      <text x="230" y="412" text-anchor="middle" class="s">via PFMS</text>
      <text x="374" y="374" text-anchor="middle" class="s b">Year 3</text>
      <text x="374" y="394" text-anchor="middle" class="s">fund cost minus</text>
      <text x="374" y="412" text-anchor="middle" class="s">revenue capacity</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Blueprint: the allocation formula and the three-year rollout from the pitch deck.</figcaption>
</figure>
